<Project>
  <!-- Isolation shim for the archived black-box workspace projects under this evaluation
       directory (model\, tests\). These projects were authored *outside* this repository,
       inside a staged investigation workspace, and are preserved here byte-for-byte as
       evidence. MSBuild imports only the nearest Directory.Build.props walking up, so this
       empty file keeps the repository-wide packaging/documentation defaults from silently
       changing how the archived copies build. See README.md, "Reproducing the build". -->
</Project>
